{"h":2857,"lines":[{"w":0.053685480753580733,"h":0.0089502968597945376,"x":0.19201539102739018,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.10453647946290257,"c":1},{"y":0.13517441827305898,"t":"MAN:","h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"w":0.036332178115844715,"x":0.19031141922494962},{"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.19025394553028485,"h":0.010624576565933963,"c":1,"y":0.23087957213411181,"w":0.055478267669677755},{"c":1,"x":0.19204152236084546,"y":0.24709302303727088,"h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.034602076212565086,"t":"MAN:"},{"c":1,"x":0.19204152170086322,"h":0.0087209305119230196,"w":0.053633219401041654,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.29505813938016523},{"y":0.3415697671587179,"t":"MAN:","w":0.036332178115844743,"c":1,"x":0.19031141969351939,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"y":0.38939457247294484,"x":0.19027006650161232,"w":0.055446027119954416,"h":0.011908529186849481},{"x":0.19204152236084546,"w":0.034602076212565086,"h":0.010174418263205087,"t":"MAN:","y":0.42296511642153045,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.45348837179050083,"h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.055363318125406902,"x":0.19031142086809238,"c":1},{"t":"Yes one of my friends did that class. She said the candles make really good","y":0.10174418612143943,"c":1,"x":0.27335639364178405,"w":0.52076126098632813,"h":0.015988371937820434},{"h":0.013296011196641033,"t":"presents. In fact she gave me one.","x":0.27681660960695886,"w":0.23875432332356772,"c":1,"y":0.1175647308941874},{"x":0.27508651522353356,"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.13365990182505716,"w":0.54152247111002605,"c":1,"t":"By the way, have you heard about the class on silk painting? That's being held"},{"h":0.016140942476778442,"t":"on the 18th of May. You learn how to create designs on silk fabric and colour","y":0.14970930240030711,"w":0.53287195841471358,"c":1,"x":0.27508651205686363},{"y":0.16569767418269477,"x":0.27335639233623721,"t":"them using special dyes. Apparently people can produce beautiful artworks that","c":1,"w":0.55882354736328121,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"x":0.27503030971164738,"h":0.01780652499349078,"t":"way, either to put on the wall as a picture or to use for something like a scarf.","y":0.17998744633388886,"w":0.53815984090169278,"c":1},{"t":"It's £67.50, which is really good value I think - there's a similar class l've seen","y":0.19622093028664722,"x":0.27508650024446363,"w":0.52941177368164061,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1},{"w":0.10553633371988935,"h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.21366279081015682,"t":"that was £110.","c":1,"x":0.27335640052296439},{"c":1,"t":"That sounds interesting. Would I need to bring the silk?","y":0.22953114040621936,"w":0.38581314086914059,"x":0.27508650906369952,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"y":0.24324450734542402,"w":0.55025131225585944,"x":0.27504276638123104,"c":1,"h":0.018465425185676732,"t":"No, the only thing is everyone has to bring something to protect their clothing,"},{"t":"like an apron if you've got one, or a shirt that you don't use any more, because","y":0.25868027362371881,"w":0.54858266194661454,"c":1,"x":0.27328584734940459,"h":0.019214375858293553},{"y":0.27746676018386873,"x":0.27335640159717733,"w":0.25778546651204426,"t":"the dye can really stain your clothes.","h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1},{"t":"Right. Then the last class I was considering was a bit different, that was on","x":0.27681659810845533,"h":0.014706779810996884,"y":0.29215116255366835,"w":0.51211074829101566,"c":1},{"w":0.53979237874348962,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"DIY for beginners. I'd like to learn how to do household repairs. Are there any","y":0.30813953495829416,"x":0.27508650949910018},{"w":0.13667819976806639,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.32400279921251207,"x":0.27508650556930081,"t":"places left on that?"},{"y":0.34009797077624948,"c":1,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"That's on the 24th of February - yes, there are a few places. It's a bit more","w":0.51384084065755209,"x":0.27335639618457513},{"x":0.27681662097085336,"w":0.51903111775716149,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"expensive - it's £125 - but it's a very popular class. You learn how to use an","y":0.35610465092605825},{"h":0.015657512352464931,"t":"electric drill and a saw.","x":0.27494874512536366,"y":0.37103645323243473,"w":0.15949779510498041,"c":1},{"y":0.38803358993603732,"w":0.55882354736328121,"t":"Yeah, that would be really useful, and I even need to learn how to use a hammer","x":0.27508649611939745,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"w":0.30103805541992185,"t":"because I always end up hitting my fingers.","y":0.40406976750314716,"x":0.27508650866458889,"h":0.016154165114448893,"c":1},{"x":0.27508651011384588,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"Yes, you'll do that too. And when you've learned how to use the basic tools, you","w":0.55536331176757814,"y":0.42005813929963265},{"y":0.43414762882025726,"c":1,"x":0.27499410968218363,"t":"do a practical job which is fixing a shelf to a wall.","w":0.33926841735839841,"h":0.019127317873058547},{"y":0.45008884942235627,"h":0.018895146561469733,"t":"Great. Just what I need to know. Right, well l'd like to enrol for that and also for","w":0.5554743448893229,"x":0.27331291291929283,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"PART 2","y":0.51876517504819231,"x":0.19201074722275091,"w":0.086566740671793596,"h":0.01479523060119925},{"t":"Here is some information about history and nature walks in the region. They can be","x":0.19377161784996691,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.54793561954477366,"w":0.57439448038736984},{"x":0.19031142414553776,"y":0.56395348844732918,"w":0.64013839721679688,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"t":"completed in less than a day and also be combined with a visit to Melby, a former coal mine"},{"w":0.16981185913085939,"h":0.016050525609223931,"c":1,"x":0.19188293506665138,"y":0.57907591819523463,"t":"now open to the public."},{"c":1,"t":"The Marsden Coastal Walk is suitable for all the family as there are no strenuous climbs.","y":0.60319767418366299,"x":0.19204152099510122,"w":0.60726643880208331,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.61918604658593956,"c":1,"t":"The route begins at Marsden harbour, where there are hourly ferries to and from the","w":0.58477508544921875,"x":0.19031141913336549},{"y":0.63505948226194808,"w":0.61764704386393232,"t":"beautiful Hooker Island, a great place for fishing. The walk covers part of the coastal path","x":0.19204152988464282,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.64970930204307942,"h":0.017540523270112462,"t":"trail. As there are clear signposts all along the way, you don't even need to take a map with","w":0.63667821248372392,"x":0.19031141268161511},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"t":"you. At one point, the route goes inland slightly and passes a castle built in the 1400s near","y":0.66715116286543374,"w":0.63148788452148441,"x":0.18858131717886542},{"c":1,"t":"to a now-vanished market town. The castle's now just a pile of stones but it's a great place","x":0.19204152734562721,"y":0.68299510173113265,"w":0.62456746419270837,"h":0.013296011196641033},{"y":0.6990902729778985,"c":1,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.63321797688802084,"t":"to take photos, and fascinating information boards show what it once looked like. If you set","x":0.19204153049760539},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.19031142264281461,"y":0.71511627914249443,"w":0.31660898844401042,"c":1,"t":"off early, you can be back in time for midday."},{"t":"The Melby Heritage Walk is a great place to take photos, especially of the night sky. At","x":0.19026748850470152,"y":0.73798769799429387,"h":0.01903740487122052,"w":0.60564036051432291,"c":1},{"y":0.75436046488096908,"w":0.6314878845214843,"c":1,"x":0.19204152479420353,"h":0.014708814627645395,"t":"certain times of the year, people come here from far and wide. They climb to the top of the"},{"t":"valley and take pictures of the stars. In the daytime, it's completely different. As you hike","x":0.19031141463923593,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"y":0.77034883728453163,"w":0.61418685913085935},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"t":"through the dense woods in the valley bottom, the only things you'll hear are the sound","x":0.19204151272510492,"y":0.7862141356950908,"w":0.61245676676432292},{"y":0.79873248074731307,"h":0.021414336998033856,"t":"of your own footsteps. At the highest point, you can stop to take in the views, and those","x":0.19024123530455087,"w":0.61434844970703129,"c":1},{"x":0.19031142097676365,"w":0.6314878845214843,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"with lots of energy can climb the tower that's situated where there was once a seventeenth","y":0.8183139535637024},{"c":1,"t":"century hunting lodge. The route continues along the tops of the hills and brings you back","w":0.62975779215494798,"h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.19031141525885156,"y":0.83414975480731135},{"c":1,"w":0.42906575520833334,"y":0.85024492672031593,"x":0.19031141296034582,"t":"down to the starting point - the car park at Melby Coal Mine.","h":0.016095171448565426},{"c":1,"w":0.62110727945963551,"t":"Melby Coal Mine has been open to the public for twenty years and has won awards for its","x":0.19204151588812796,"y":0.8953488372845243,"h":0.016127719839108101},{"c":1,"x":0.19204152737656216,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"visitor experience. Many of the buildings around the mine are still standing and have been","y":0.91133720906617244,"w":0.62456746419270837},{"y":0.92596076227114532,"w":0.20118951161702472,"c":1,"h":0.016958503643059952,"t":"converted into display areas.","x":0.19183778501563428},{"c":1,"h":0.015542492823136911,"x":0.86139765759463638,"t":"Test 2","y":0.053275265188704513,"w":0.052291189829508422},{"x":0.85294117619433829,"y":0.19767441836995825,"w":0.024221453666687043,"t":"Q8","c":1,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"w":0.024221453666687043,"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"t":"09","y":0.26162790704640049,"x":0.85294117619433829},{"h":0.013741989082352468,"w":0.05730321884155265,"c":1,"t":"Q11\/12","y":0.6508324937802229,"x":0.85110617607879346},{"w":0.057287336985270221,"t":"Q11\/12","y":0.68428829872004726,"x":0.8511141168883144,"h":0.013690844376325839,"c":1},{"x":0.85112131776735467,"h":0.01224547053150904,"c":1,"y":0.81945866006394918,"w":0.055542831420898442,"t":"Q13\/14"},{"t":"Q13\/14","y":0.83705105389049239,"h":0.013397892177146598,"c":1,"w":0.055468279520670571,"x":0.85115859371734115},{"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"103","x":0.87716263032581798,"y":0.95348837178754475,"h":0.014534884186538477}],"w":2400}